ed)","+      timerManager.createTimer(timerId = 1, delay = 0, repeat = false)","+","+      timerManager.onInstanceDestroy()","+      timerManager.onHeadlessJsTaskStart(taskId = 1)","+      val captor = argumentCaptor<Choreographer.FrameCallback>()","+      verify(reactChoreographer, atLeastOnce())","+          .postFrameCallback(eq(ReactChoreographer.CallbackType.TIMERS_EVENTS), captor.capture())","+      clearInvocations(reactChoreographer)","+      captor.lastValue.doFrame(Long.MAX_VALUE)","+","+      verify(timerExecutor, never()).callTimers(any())","+      verify(reactChoreographer, never())","+          .postFrameCallback(eq(ReactChoreographer.CallbackType.TIMERS_EVENTS), any())","+    }","+  }","+","+  @Test","+  fun `timers wait for host resume without the flag`() {","+    newTimerManager(keepTimersRunningWhileHostPaused = false)","+","+    verify(reactChoreographer, never())","+        .postFrameCallback(eq(ReactChoreographer.CallbackType.TIMERS_EVENTS), any())","+  }","+}"],"additions":143,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/react-native/ReactCommon/react/featureflags/ReactNativeFeatureFlags.cpp","lines":["@@ -4,7 +4,7 @@","  * This source code is licensed under the MIT license found in the","  * LICENSE file in the root directory of this source tree.","  *","- * @generated SignedSource<<493a51a28c2f55411c5c5aea374638d1>>","+ * @generated SignedSource<<3acecfdec6d182a74c4616d6c8690e72>>","  */"," "," /**","@@ -302,6 +302,10 @@ bool ReactNativeFeatureFlags::fuseboxWebSocketEventsEnabled() {","   return getAccessor().fuseboxWebSocketEventsEnabled();"," }"," ","+bool ReactNativeFeatureFlags::keepTimersRunningWhileHostPausedAndroid() {","+  return getAccessor().keepTimersRunningWhileHostPausedAndroid();","+}","+"," bool ReactNativeFeatureFlags::optimizedAnimatedPropUpdates() {","   return getAccessor().optimizedAnimatedPropUpdates();"," }"],"additions":5,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"packages/react-native/ReactCommon/react/featureflag